msgid ""
"This task allows you to backup/restore savedata for MiiMaker, Internet Browser and other system titles.\n"
"\n"
"Proceed with caution and be aware of what you are modifying! Some saves can affect system behavior, and misuse on them can have unexpected consequences!\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?\n"
